    <!-- object types: 0x0eXX next: 0x0e00 -->

    <!--
    *********************************************************************************

    CustomParticles

    *********************************************************************************
    CustomParticles Notes:
        size: Individual particle size
        rate: particles produced per second
        rangeX and rangeY: Distance from the generator (left and right or up and down) where the particles can be created. 1 is equal to one tile
        zOffset: Generator will add the offset to all particle start locations. E.G. zOffset = 4 (along with a downward rise value) will make it look like rain.
        life and lifeVariance: Duration of particle in seconds
        speed and speedVariance: Speed along the ground (x/y) are both independently generated by these. This can cause diagonal particles to potentially move more quickly
        rise and riseVariance: Vertical speed
        riseAcc: Vertical acceleration. (Gravity might be something like -.001)
        bitmapFile and bitmapIndex: Sets a bitmap to represent the particle
        color: Color of the particle that will be generated. Ignored if a bitmapFile/bitmapIndex are defined
     -->
    
        
    
  
    
          
